WEBVTT

02:07.600 --> 02:09.360
Why is Mr. Yue Qin here?

02:14.280 --> 02:15.320
Shumo.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.760
What…?

02:35.560 --> 02:37.000
Zhang Yin wants to silence Meiniang.

02:37.080 --> 02:38.480
Here they come.

02:38.560 --> 02:40.200
Come on.

02:45.200 --> 02:46.240
Mei Lin?

03:06.960 --> 03:07.800
Where is your master?

03:21.920 --> 03:22.920
Meiniang?

03:26.240 --> 03:27.320
Meiniang?

03:36.680 --> 03:38.800
Thanks for the travel permits, Meiniang.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.840
TRAVEL PERMIT

03:47.400 --> 03:48.240
It's you!

03:55.160 --> 03:56.120
Shumo.

03:56.200 --> 03:57.200
Mr. Yue Qin.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.640
- Take him away first.
- What about you?

03:59.720 --> 04:01.000
We'll speak later.

04:01.920 --> 04:04.040
Shumo, give me your cloak.

04:06.800 --> 04:08.600
I am a vengeful spirit from Qingzhou.

04:19.560 --> 04:20.800
Speak!

04:20.880 --> 04:22.079
Who else is responsible
for the massacre in Qingzhou?

04:22.920 --> 04:23.800
Tell me!

04:23.880 --> 04:25.680
Who else was involved?

04:26.680 --> 04:29.240
Murong Jinghe. It was him!

04:33.520 --> 04:34.880
She knows what she is doing.

04:40.720 --> 04:43.120
Stop hitting me. Just kill me.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.000
Kill you?

04:46.560 --> 04:47.680
That would be too easy for you.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.920
There are people downstairs watching us.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.200
I'll divert them with Mei Lin,

04:51.280 --> 04:52.600
then you take our men and leave.

04:52.680 --> 04:53.520
Yes, Your Highness.

04:59.280 --> 05:00.120
Fresh flowers!

05:00.880 --> 05:01.720
Come and take a look.

05:04.960 --> 05:06.400
I've heard that this year,
fire dragon parade changes its route.

05:07.000 --> 05:09.000
Qingyang Restaurant is the best place
to enjoy the view.

05:09.760 --> 05:12.360
Shall we head up for a look?

05:14.440 --> 05:15.400
Thank you, Your Highness.

05:17.320 --> 05:18.240
Someone.

05:20.160 --> 05:22.440
- Your Highness.
- Escort General Yin upstairs.

05:22.520 --> 05:24.120
This way, please, General Yin.

05:25.000 --> 05:25.840
Take it slow.

05:26.760 --> 05:27.600
This way.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.600
Your Highness, we lost track of them.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.560
Fufang Pavilion. He must be there.

05:34.640 --> 05:35.480
Yes, Your Highness.

05:37.320 --> 05:40.440
Third Brother, what are you planning?

05:46.840 --> 05:50.800
QINGYANG RESTAURANT

05:50.880 --> 05:54.800
FUFANG PAVILION

05:57.400 --> 05:58.440
Did you get hurt?

06:02.600 --> 06:03.800
This is Zhang Yin's blood.

06:04.960 --> 06:05.840
My lord,

06:06.400 --> 06:08.520
Meiniang is actually Shumo,
the man by Mr. Yue Qin's side.

06:10.320 --> 06:11.560
You knew there was an ambush,

06:12.080 --> 06:14.480
so why do you put yourself in danger
over matters that don't concern you?

06:15.440 --> 06:17.600
Mr. Yue Qin's matters do concern me.

06:18.120 --> 06:18.960
I owe him a debt of gratitude.

06:19.920 --> 06:21.960
I saw him enter Meiniang's room.

06:22.040 --> 06:23.560
I couldn't just watch and let him die.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.120
But for helping Zhang Yin escape,

06:25.200 --> 06:26.680
he deserves to die. He's not worth saving.

06:27.280 --> 06:28.880
Mr. Yue Qin knew nothing of it.

06:30.960 --> 06:31.800
Mei Lin,

06:32.760 --> 06:35.560
haven't I told you to stay away from him?

06:35.640 --> 06:37.120
Rest assured, my lord.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.680
Repaying a debt
won't interfere with my revenge.

06:40.280 --> 06:41.400
Then choose.

06:41.480 --> 06:43.040
Either follow Yue Qin and repay him

06:43.640 --> 06:45.720
or follow me and seek revenge.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.960
You can only pick one.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.960
- I…
- If you follow me,

06:49.040 --> 06:50.920
you must obey my orders.

08:01.040 --> 08:03.080
Luomei, what do you think?

08:03.160 --> 08:04.520
It is truly a magnificent sight.

08:05.280 --> 08:07.080
The night view of Zhaojing
is splendid and prosperous.

08:09.080 --> 08:10.640
If not for the Pingnan Army soldiers

08:10.720 --> 08:12.600
braving the elements to guard our borders,

08:13.440 --> 08:15.400
there would be no such peace
and prosperity in Zhaojing,

08:15.480 --> 08:16.400
nor such a flourishing country.

08:21.640 --> 08:24.160
May the gods protect the Pingnan Army,

08:24.240 --> 08:26.480
granting them victory in every battle.

08:28.680 --> 08:30.120
If there were ever an invincible army,

08:30.200 --> 08:31.280
that would be a blessing indeed.

08:33.400 --> 08:36.080
May the underworld's lords
protect the heroic spirits of Great Yan,

08:36.159 --> 08:37.720
and may the deceased rest in peace.

08:45.280 --> 08:46.560
This,

08:46.640 --> 08:49.320
I raise to the hope
that peace will reign in our lands,

08:49.400 --> 08:50.600
that Great Yan will forever flourish.

08:51.480 --> 08:54.160
May the people of Great Yan
be free from the ravages of war,

08:54.240 --> 08:55.080
living in eternal peace and safety.

09:03.400 --> 09:05.200
On behalf of the soldiers of Great Yan,

09:05.920 --> 09:07.240
thank you, Your Highness.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.160
Luomei.

09:20.760 --> 09:22.080
The prayer was for the public,

09:22.160 --> 09:23.440
but this moment of companionship
is for something more personal.

09:24.880 --> 09:27.280
This private affection,
even Noble Consort Yin has noticed it.

09:29.240 --> 09:30.480
Surely, you have, too.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.600
Your Highness.

09:33.680 --> 09:36.400
I have always said there is
no need for formality between us.

09:39.840 --> 09:40.960
There has only ever been one person

09:41.600 --> 09:42.600
destined to be my Crown Princess, you.

09:47.880 --> 09:50.160
I've risked my life on the battlefield,

09:50.880 --> 09:53.520
all to escape the fate
of being confined to the inner chambers.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.760
Your Highness, you should know.

09:55.840 --> 09:57.800
my ambition lies far from the palace.

09:59.800 --> 10:00.880
If you so wish,

10:00.960 --> 10:02.360
you could be the first Crown Princess

10:02.920 --> 10:04.760
of Great Yan to lead soldiers into battle.

10:05.480 --> 10:06.600
And perhaps even
its first Empress to do so.

10:16.160 --> 10:17.000
Look.

10:17.680 --> 10:18.880
The fire dragon has changed its course.

10:23.880 --> 10:25.320
The best place to watch it has shifted.

10:25.840 --> 10:27.480
In this world, everything changes.

10:29.240 --> 10:32.720
Clinging to childhood memories
will make you miss even better sights.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.760
The eyes follow the heart.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.760
The true beauty of a scene
lies in the joy it brings.

10:43.600 --> 10:45.800
The view from Qingyang Restaurant
may be spectacular,

10:46.600 --> 10:48.560
allowing us to see
the full scope of the fire dragon,

10:49.120 --> 10:50.280
but Fufang Pavilion

10:50.920 --> 10:52.600
offers a different kind
of bustling energy.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.160
I…

10:56.960 --> 10:58.480
prefer livelier places.

11:06.120 --> 11:07.240
The people from Fufang Pavilion

11:09.360 --> 11:11.320
have already gone to Zhixiang Tower.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.240
I'll take this one.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.800
- Welcome to come again!
- Let's see the fire dragon!

12:20.880 --> 12:23.080
Lanterns for sale, fancy lanterns!

12:23.160 --> 12:24.240
Sir. Sir.

12:24.920 --> 12:26.480
How about a lantern for your lady?

12:27.240 --> 12:28.520
- We're…
- Feel free to browse.

12:28.600 --> 12:30.440
This year's Shangsi Festival is beautiful!

12:32.200 --> 12:33.160
Feel free.

12:34.240 --> 12:36.440
- This one.
- Alright. Here you go.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.320
My lord?

12:46.200 --> 12:47.040
I don't have any money.

12:48.560 --> 12:49.640
Hurry up.

12:59.400 --> 13:00.800
Thank you, sir. Thank you.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.920
Lanterns for sale!

13:06.720 --> 13:09.000
- Fancy lanterns!
- After I escaped from Qingzhou,

13:09.080 --> 13:10.880
I traveled with a stray dog for a while.

13:11.560 --> 13:13.040
That dog was fierce.

13:13.120 --> 13:16.160
It would steal the wild vegetables
and buns I scavenged.

13:17.320 --> 13:18.960
To avoid starving,

13:19.040 --> 13:20.880
I had to fight it for food.

13:23.160 --> 13:24.280
Look here, my lord.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.400
This scar is from the dog's bite.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.240
Later on,

13:31.040 --> 13:32.720
it kept following me.

13:32.800 --> 13:35.200
Eventually, I got used to it.

13:36.080 --> 13:38.600
Having it by my side, it protected me.

13:39.560 --> 13:40.880
If anyone bullied me,

13:41.440 --> 13:42.960
it would bite them back.

13:46.520 --> 13:47.360
My lord.

13:49.760 --> 13:50.600
I'm giving this to you.

13:54.560 --> 13:56.160
This dog lantern suits you perfectly.

14:05.720 --> 14:07.560
How dare you!

14:08.560 --> 14:11.160
Comparing me to a dog!

14:12.520 --> 14:14.720
That dog was my only companion

14:15.640 --> 14:16.840
after the fire in Qingzhou.

14:57.600 --> 14:58.880
EXEMPLARY CONDUCT AND VIRTUE

14:58.960 --> 15:01.480
You should have told me
all of this long ago.

15:01.560 --> 15:03.600
I was foolish.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.680
I was deceived by Zhang Yin,

15:06.360 --> 15:08.480
thinking I could keep everything hidden

15:09.520 --> 15:12.160
and still help you send Mei Lin away.

15:15.000 --> 15:17.600
In the end,
it's me who dragged you into this mess.

15:27.200 --> 15:29.480
Zhang Yin had me smuggle goods to Xiyan,

15:30.120 --> 15:32.240
but he secretly brought them back
to Great Yan.

15:33.080 --> 15:35.240
They're hidden in the West Mountain Mine.

15:35.840 --> 15:37.240
I suspect

15:38.640 --> 15:41.280
the mine holds evidence
against the Crown Prince.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.280
If you use this information

15:46.040 --> 15:47.280
to earn the Crown Prince's help,

15:48.320 --> 15:50.040
perhaps you can find safety,

15:51.200 --> 15:52.640
return to Xiyan.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.160
Here.

16:05.960 --> 16:07.000
Shumo.

16:10.920 --> 16:11.760
Rest assured.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.600
I'll take care of the rest.

16:15.480 --> 16:17.120
You need to focus on recovering.

16:20.840 --> 16:21.680
Let me help you.

16:46.520 --> 16:50.840
EXEMPLARY CONDUCT AND VIRTUE

16:57.120 --> 16:59.400
- How is it?
- The arrow was poisoned.

16:59.480 --> 17:01.840
Even with the finest medicines,

17:02.440 --> 17:04.200
he will have at most…

17:04.960 --> 17:05.960
three days.

17:38.680 --> 17:39.720
Minister Zhang,

17:40.440 --> 17:42.040
how does the food

17:42.120 --> 17:44.120
at my mansion compare to the meals
at the Eastern Palace?

17:45.960 --> 17:46.800
It's the same.

17:46.880 --> 17:49.280
Both are the last meals for the condemned.

17:50.280 --> 17:52.560
I thought you had grown too comfortable

17:52.640 --> 17:54.040
over the years,

17:54.120 --> 17:55.280
that your spine had hardened,

17:55.920 --> 17:56.960
and you weren't afraid of death anymore.

18:01.240 --> 18:02.200
My lord, you know,

18:02.280 --> 18:04.280
I'm just a pawn in someone else's hands,
like a dog on a leash.

18:04.360 --> 18:05.400
If you kill me,

18:05.480 --> 18:07.080
you'll only dirty your hands.

18:09.520 --> 18:11.400
At least you're self-aware.

18:11.480 --> 18:14.480
But I keep you well-fed for a reason.

18:15.160 --> 18:17.040
To bite.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.560
You want me to turn on the Crown Prince?

18:30.640 --> 18:31.920
The Crown Prince falls,

18:34.440 --> 18:35.600
and you'll live.

18:40.200 --> 18:42.880
You know, there were two masterminds

18:42.960 --> 18:43.960
behind the Qingzhou fire.

18:44.040 --> 18:46.880
One was the strategist Li Qing,
advisor to Prince Xuanlie at the time.

18:46.960 --> 18:49.480
The other was me.

18:49.560 --> 18:52.840
That strategist was silenced years ago,

18:52.920 --> 18:53.880
but I chose to play the scapegoat

18:53.960 --> 18:56.880
to prove my loyalty,
and that's how I survived.

18:57.880 --> 19:01.720
I'm the only living witness who
can testify against the Crown Prince.

19:01.800 --> 19:03.440
Surely, Your Highness,

19:03.520 --> 19:05.480
you know this well by now.

19:09.680 --> 19:11.600
You should consider yourself lucky.

19:12.520 --> 19:13.360
You still

19:14.280 --> 19:16.720
have value as a dog.

19:38.480 --> 19:40.160
Roast meat.

19:40.240 --> 19:41.880
Qingyang Restaurant makes it the best.

19:42.480 --> 19:45.840
The pork needs to be smoked
with pine wood, perfect with wine.

19:45.920 --> 19:47.120
This…

19:50.360 --> 19:51.480
My lord.

19:51.560 --> 19:53.760
A dog needs to eat well
to have the strength to bite, right?

19:58.800 --> 20:01.160
Do you really think I believe

20:01.760 --> 20:04.160
a dog about to bite its master

20:04.240 --> 20:06.440
cares about what it eats?

20:09.440 --> 20:11.320
If I'm not mistaken,

20:11.920 --> 20:13.400
Qingyang Restaurant has spies

20:14.320 --> 20:16.000
working for the Crown Prince.

20:25.320 --> 20:28.440
Pork head. That's the signal, right?

20:35.480 --> 20:36.600
Do you still think

20:37.400 --> 20:40.120
your master will come to save you?

20:45.760 --> 20:47.720
Even if I help you,

20:47.800 --> 20:49.800
I'm still as good as dead, aren't I?

20:57.800 --> 20:58.720
WEIBEI

20:58.800 --> 21:01.880
This. Does this look familiar?

21:03.200 --> 21:04.280
You created it.

21:05.200 --> 21:07.720
Life or death.

21:08.480 --> 21:09.480
It depends on you.

21:13.200 --> 21:16.280
My lord. Wait! My lord.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.680
My lord. I have more proof.

21:24.080 --> 21:25.360
Even if I speak out,

21:25.440 --> 21:27.000
it won't be enough
to convict the Crown Prince.

21:27.080 --> 21:29.520
Ten years ago,
I wasn't yet working for him.

21:30.880 --> 21:33.680
The only person
who can destroy the Crown Prince now

21:33.760 --> 21:35.800
is the strategist Li Qing.

21:40.320 --> 21:41.600
Li Qing is still alive?

21:44.800 --> 21:46.600
No wonder you survived

21:46.680 --> 21:48.240
and dared to contact the Crown Prince.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.760
So, that's your life-saving card.

21:50.840 --> 21:52.160
My lord.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.800
Spare my life,

21:53.880 --> 21:55.760
and I'll tell you where Li Qing is.

21:56.320 --> 21:59.120
I'm the only one in the world who knows.

22:02.560 --> 22:06.280
It seems I underestimated you,
Minister Zhang.

22:10.640 --> 22:13.800
Confirm if Li Qing is indeed
at the West Mountain Mine.

22:13.880 --> 22:14.720
Yes, my lord.

22:22.920 --> 22:26.160
Infiltrate the peace-making
marriage delegation of Xiyan

22:26.240 --> 22:29.040
and assassinate
the third prince of Great Yan,

22:29.120 --> 22:31.280
Murong Jinghe.

22:31.360 --> 22:33.040
Prince Jing has discovered us.

22:34.040 --> 22:36.440
If the Qingzhou case is reopened,
I'm as good as dead.

22:37.880 --> 22:40.840
Everyone, cease all actions
and go into hiding among the civilians.

22:46.600 --> 22:48.000
You've been waiting for a long time?

22:53.680 --> 22:56.000
What grudge do Zhang Yin and you have
that he had

22:56.840 --> 22:59.680
to drag innocent Qingzhou civilians
to their deaths?

23:01.760 --> 23:04.760
Zhang Yin and his Momai Warriors
were just pawns.

23:05.480 --> 23:07.960
The one you should hate
is the man behind it all.

23:08.760 --> 23:10.000
My elder brother,

23:10.600 --> 23:12.120
the Crown Prince of Great Yan,

23:12.840 --> 23:14.000
Murong Xuanlie.

23:22.200 --> 23:26.360
If I had returned victorious
from recapturing Qingzhou,

23:26.440 --> 23:29.200
I would've been sitting pretty
as the Crown Prince.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.760
But my brother coveted the position,

23:32.680 --> 23:33.560
so,

23:33.640 --> 23:36.160
he turned General Weibei,
who had saved Qingzhou,

23:36.880 --> 23:39.640
into the mass murderer general
who slaughtered civilians.

23:41.720 --> 23:42.760
I heard

23:43.640 --> 23:45.800
the Crown Prince was raised
by your mother.

23:46.680 --> 23:47.920
Then you…?

23:49.320 --> 23:51.240
Once, we were close as brothers.

23:52.120 --> 23:52.960
Now,

23:53.920 --> 23:55.600
it's kill or be killed.

24:01.800 --> 24:02.840
What about you?

24:03.680 --> 24:06.120
Aren't you afraid
of opposing the Crown Prince?

24:06.200 --> 24:07.240
Ha, the Crown Prince?

24:08.840 --> 24:12.520
He bought his position
with the lives of innocent civilians.

24:13.160 --> 24:15.040
I will kill him with my own hands.

24:16.040 --> 24:17.440
At worst, it's a life for a life.

24:19.120 --> 24:22.280
If my death can take down
the Crown Prince,

24:22.360 --> 24:23.200
it's worth it.

24:25.360 --> 24:26.560
Killing him is too merciful.

24:28.160 --> 24:29.200
What we should do

24:29.880 --> 24:32.520
is make him atone
for Qingzhou's 100,000 souls,

24:32.600 --> 24:35.200
for the innocent Weibei soldiers who died.

24:35.760 --> 24:37.720
He should confess his sins
before the world.

24:39.080 --> 24:42.880
So, to defeat the Crown Prince,
we don't need to trade lives.

24:43.960 --> 24:46.480
It would be a waste if you died.

24:56.360 --> 24:59.400
Prince Jing and Mei Lin
are working against the Crown Prince.

24:59.480 --> 25:02.520
Could the Crown Prince
be the true culprit of Qingzhou fire?

25:03.560 --> 25:05.520
Mr. Yue Qin.

25:05.600 --> 25:06.440
Shumo…

25:08.640 --> 25:11.680
EXEMPLARY CONDUCT AND VIRTUE

25:14.480 --> 25:15.560
Your Highness.

25:24.160 --> 25:26.720
Lie down and rest.
I've taken care of everything.

25:27.400 --> 25:30.440
Zigu won't be harmed, and neither will I.

25:31.280 --> 25:32.160
We'll return to Xiyan together.

25:32.960 --> 25:33.800
Have some rest…

25:39.080 --> 25:40.200
That's good to hear.

25:41.560 --> 25:42.680
That's good to hear.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.400
After you return to Xiyan,

25:46.080 --> 25:48.120
you'll need to manage some connections.

25:49.440 --> 25:52.520
I've already prepared gifts for you.

25:53.200 --> 25:55.360
They're stored
in the side courtyard warehouse.

25:59.200 --> 26:00.720
I'm not exaggerating.

26:01.440 --> 26:02.600
With your talents,

26:04.240 --> 26:05.560
if you wish it,

26:07.720 --> 26:10.000
the throne of Xiyan could be yours.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.480
And that bamboo brew.

26:18.320 --> 26:20.200
It's been specially prepared
for the Princess.

26:21.120 --> 26:23.240
Make sure to remind her

26:24.360 --> 26:25.640
not to drink too much.

26:41.120 --> 26:42.960
TEA RECIPE FOR EYE CARE

26:43.720 --> 26:45.640
You always like

26:46.400 --> 26:48.160
to carve wood figurines late at night,

26:48.240 --> 26:49.560
burning oil,

26:50.960 --> 26:52.760
and straining your eyes.

26:54.120 --> 26:57.880
This tea recipe,
I found it to protect your eyes.

27:05.720 --> 27:07.640
As for that boy Yunqi.

27:07.720 --> 27:08.960
He's quite clever.

27:11.120 --> 27:14.440
Over the years, I have kept him
by my side, teaching him everything.

27:16.040 --> 27:19.160
He knows all your preferences.

27:19.880 --> 27:22.200
With him around,

27:23.480 --> 27:26.240
- I can rest easy.
- Enough.

27:30.040 --> 27:31.120
I only need you

27:32.600 --> 27:33.720
by my side.

27:46.560 --> 27:47.400
Your Highness.

27:48.720 --> 27:50.200
I'm tired.

27:51.560 --> 27:53.000
Please,

27:53.080 --> 27:56.440
could you pass me the wooden tiger tooth
from the table?

28:01.920 --> 28:03.600
You said…

28:06.280 --> 28:08.360
it's meant to protect people.

28:13.120 --> 28:13.960
Alright.

28:44.640 --> 28:45.560
Shumo!

29:15.640 --> 29:17.120
Damaging a sacred object

29:17.200 --> 29:18.560
means your entire family
faces execution by strangulation.

29:18.640 --> 29:20.520
It was an accident!

29:23.040 --> 29:24.320
Wait for me.

29:30.920 --> 29:32.200
Mother once told me,

29:32.280 --> 29:34.160
living people are more important
than wood.

29:37.360 --> 29:38.200
After all,

29:38.280 --> 29:39.760
the sacred object's purpose
is to protect people.

29:39.840 --> 29:40.760
I don't have to die anymore.

29:41.880 --> 29:42.840
Thank you for saving my life,
Your Highness.

29:42.920 --> 29:45.200
My whole family is saved!

29:46.320 --> 29:47.520
Don't mention death.

29:47.600 --> 29:49.160
I hate seeing it.

30:03.640 --> 30:04.480
It's okay.

30:08.720 --> 30:11.120
I'm not a scared eight-year-old anymore.

30:17.800 --> 30:19.760
There's nothing to fear.

30:28.520 --> 30:32.040
The Yisang flower is used in Xiyan
to honor the dead.

30:32.800 --> 30:36.360
In Great Yan,
we don't grow such inauspicious flowers.

30:43.000 --> 30:44.160
Your Highness.

30:45.680 --> 30:46.800
Your Highness.

30:47.960 --> 30:49.520
I couldn't find any Yisang flowers.

30:49.600 --> 30:51.600
What about you? Did you find any?

31:17.240 --> 31:18.360
We came here together,

31:19.520 --> 31:21.280
we must return home together.

31:29.640 --> 31:31.200
When we first arrived in Great Yan,

31:32.360 --> 31:33.600
the household was lacking in money,

31:33.680 --> 31:35.160
and we barely had enough to eat.

31:36.520 --> 31:37.800
I always thought

31:38.560 --> 31:40.240
you sold my wooden carvings

31:40.960 --> 31:42.520
to improve our situation.

31:45.640 --> 31:46.720
Who would've guessed

31:48.960 --> 31:50.200
that the money came

31:53.440 --> 31:55.000
from your smuggling operations?

31:59.880 --> 32:02.120
You took on so much risk for me.

32:03.600 --> 32:05.360
It's I who burdened you.

32:23.400 --> 32:25.040
I couldn't protect you.

32:27.440 --> 32:28.480
I can't even

32:29.480 --> 32:31.880
carve a simple Yisang flower properly.

32:33.040 --> 32:34.640
Not even a single flower…

32:47.760 --> 32:48.680
Miss Mei Lin.

32:48.760 --> 32:49.760
Where is Mr. Yue Qin?

32:50.560 --> 32:52.640
After His Highness returned,
he locked himself in his room,

32:52.720 --> 32:54.000
refusing to see anyone.

33:02.040 --> 33:02.880
Shumo…

33:06.280 --> 33:08.840
I can't even carve a single Yisang flower.

33:12.400 --> 33:15.440
A small, simple Yisang flower…

33:19.160 --> 33:20.040
I can't carve it.

33:21.600 --> 33:22.440
I can't.

33:27.280 --> 33:28.480
Your Highness.

33:39.200 --> 33:41.480
I embroidered this Yisang flower sash.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.760
I know that in Xiyan,

33:46.360 --> 33:48.920
if a person from Xiyan dies
in a foreign land,

33:50.600 --> 33:53.360
a Yisang flower sash must be placed
in a high spot.

34:07.360 --> 34:09.400
Let's send Shumo home together.

34:31.600 --> 34:34.159
Yisang flower, a ladder to the heavens.

34:34.800 --> 34:37.000
We beseech the god to guide the soul home.

35:10.560 --> 35:11.920
With the Yisang flower sash here,

35:12.920 --> 35:14.440
Shumo has returned home.

35:21.720 --> 35:22.560
Mei Lin,

35:23.480 --> 35:24.440
come with me.

35:25.800 --> 35:28.560
I can't stand by and watch you
meet the same end as Shumo.

35:29.640 --> 35:30.480
Mr. Yue Qin,

35:32.000 --> 35:33.440
I'll protect myself.

35:34.520 --> 35:36.880
But the path you've chosen
is lined with thorns.

35:37.480 --> 35:39.000
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

35:41.040 --> 35:44.000
I never thought
there was any other path for me.

35:45.240 --> 35:46.640
There's no turning back.

35:52.880 --> 35:54.240
Since you've made up your mind,

35:57.800 --> 35:59.120
I hope this will help you.

35:59.960 --> 36:02.200
These letters were left by Shumo.

36:03.440 --> 36:05.880
I know that you're working
with Prince Jing.

36:07.000 --> 36:09.600
The most important clues
must be kept in your own hands.

36:10.240 --> 36:12.760
That's the only way
to avoid becoming a pawn,

36:12.840 --> 36:14.360
thrown away to die.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.760
No matter what you choose to do,

36:17.520 --> 36:18.960
I just want you to survive.

36:25.520 --> 36:26.480
Thank you, Mr. Yue Qin.

36:32.760 --> 36:34.240
The letters only mention

36:34.320 --> 36:35.920
Shumo helping Zhang Yin smuggle goods

36:36.000 --> 36:38.000
to the West Mountain Mine.

36:39.040 --> 36:40.840
Why would that be evidence
against the Crown Prince?

36:43.560 --> 36:44.880
To protect himself,

36:44.960 --> 36:46.200
Zhang Yin has been hiding

36:46.280 --> 36:48.880
a key witness from the Qingzhou fire.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.400
The Crown Prince's strategist, Li Qing.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.640
All these years,

36:53.720 --> 36:55.720
he's been using Shumo's smuggling

36:55.800 --> 36:57.000
to stay in contact with Li Qing.

36:57.600 --> 36:58.880
So, Your Highness,

36:58.960 --> 37:00.640
Li Qing is hiding
in the West Mountain Mine?

37:02.120 --> 37:03.440
That's right.

37:03.520 --> 37:06.240
And Li Qing is even more important
than Zhang Yin.

37:06.880 --> 37:08.440
When should we capture him?

37:09.200 --> 37:11.600
Capturing Li Qing
requires careful planning.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.720
If we aren't prepared,

37:14.560 --> 37:16.560
it will arouse
the Crown Prince's suspicion.

37:19.960 --> 37:20.800
So, for now,

37:21.520 --> 37:23.520
you just need to play the role
of my Beauty.

37:25.080 --> 37:26.680
Yue Qin gave you these things

37:27.280 --> 37:29.080
to teach you how to manipulate me.

37:31.680 --> 37:33.760
Too bad his schemes were in vain.

37:34.800 --> 37:37.720
Mr. Yue Qin doesn't truly understand
your character, Your Highness.

37:38.600 --> 37:40.240
His worries are natural.

37:41.680 --> 37:43.120
Then tell me,

37:43.800 --> 37:45.240
what kind of person do you think I am?

37:47.280 --> 37:48.320
You are…

37:50.240 --> 37:52.240
different

37:53.160 --> 37:54.360
from the reckless princes.

37:58.960 --> 38:01.280
Mr. Yue Qin is helping us.

38:02.400 --> 38:05.520
I wonder
if he'll make it back to Xiyan safely.

38:07.600 --> 38:10.600
Shumo's crimes will be erased
by my people.

38:11.200 --> 38:12.440
Yue Qin has nothing to do with this,

38:13.600 --> 38:15.000
and he'll return safely.

38:23.680 --> 38:24.960
As for you,

38:25.480 --> 38:27.240
whatever debts you owe him,
they're settled now.

38:27.880 --> 38:28.720
From now on,

38:28.800 --> 38:31.400
don't concern yourself with people
who don't matter.

38:54.760 --> 38:56.240
This dog lantern suits you perfectly.

38:57.160 --> 38:58.640
How dare you!

38:59.760 --> 39:02.240
Comparing me to a dog!

39:03.120 --> 39:05.360
That dog was my only companion

39:06.200 --> 39:07.600
after the fire in Qingzhou.

39:14.160 --> 39:15.760
if I were just a tool,

39:16.720 --> 39:18.360
you would have perished long ago.

39:19.480 --> 39:20.400
To avenge Qingzhou,

39:20.480 --> 39:21.920
I am willing to be a sharp blade.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.880
Even if it means cutting myself.

39:23.960 --> 39:25.120
I have no regrets.

39:42.400 --> 39:43.760
It bit you,

39:44.760 --> 39:46.600
yet you still made it your friend.

39:50.080 --> 39:51.360
You're a fool.
